{
 "id": "IgReelTranscripts01",
 "name": "Transcribe Instagram Reels from a creator's profile to Google Sheets with Apify",
 "active": false,
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "sticky-main",
   "name": "Overview",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -980,
    -300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "width": 700,
    "height": 800,
    "content": "# Transcribe Instagram Reels from a creator's profile to Google Sheets with Apify\n\nGive it one Instagram handle and get that creator's most recent reels as text: the first-3-seconds hook, the full spoken transcript, language, duration, caption, plays and likes, one row per reel, appended to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Who it's for\nCreative strategists, UGC teams and social managers who study what a creator actually says in their reels, at volume, without watching each one.\n\n### How it works\n1. A Set node holds the creator's handle, how many recent reels to read, and whether to read on-screen text off silent reels.\n2. An HTTP Request runs the Instagram Reel Transcript Scraper on Apify: it lists the creator's latest reels itself, transcribes the speech and extracts the opening hook. Reels with no speech come back as uncharged rows.\n3. A Set node tidies the fields and a Google Sheets node appends one row per reel.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create an HTTP Header Auth credential (name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`) and select it on the HTTP Request node.\n2. Connect Google Sheets and pick the spreadsheet and sheet.\n3. Open the Config node, set the handle (`nasa`, `@nasa` or a profile URL) and how many reels to read.\n4. Run the workflow.\n\n### Requirements\nAn Apify account and a Google account. A 10-reel test is about $0.15 on the free plan; the first 3 minutes of each reel are included, and a longer video adds $0.005 per started minute past that.\n\n### Customization tips\nLoop over a list of handles to cover several creators. Switch `includeOnScreenText` on to read text off silent reels. Add a Schedule Trigger and the actor's watchlist fields (`watchlistId`, `newReelsOnly`) to pay only for new reels each week.\n"
   }
  },
  {
